{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enrollUserPresence","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"savePrivateKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:4Core13SecKeyAddTypeO","text":"SecKeyAddType","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.ibm.verify.ios.sdk\/documentation\/Core\/SecKeyAddType","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"savePrivateKey","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A closure that receives the generated private key wrapped in a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SecKeyAddType"},{"text":" and returns the label under which the key was stored. The closure may throw if storage fails.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The function generates a new private\/public key pair, stores the private key using the provided storage function, and then performs the enrollment using the resulting key name and public key.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The caller supplies a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"savePrivateKey"},{"type":"text","text":" closure, which receives a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SecKeyAddType"},{"type":"text","text":" describing the private key that should be persisted. In this enrollment flow, the closure will always be invoked with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SecKeyAddType.key"},{"type":"text","text":", containing:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"the raw private key data ("},{"code":"Data","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"the key size in bits","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"the algorithm used to generate the key","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"code":["import Core","","try await enrollUserPresence(","    savePrivateKey: { key in","        \/\/ We know only `.key` will be passed","        guard case let .key(value, size, algorithm) = key else {","            throw MFARegistrationError.invalidRegistrationData(reason: \"Expected SecKeyAddType.key but received a different case.\")","        }","","        \/\/ Generate a unique label for the key","        let keyLabel = \"\\(UUID().uuidString).userPresence\"","","        try KeychainService.default.addItem(keyLabel, value: .key(value: value, size: size, algorithm: algorithm))","        return keyLabel","    }",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When storing the key, use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SecAccessControlCreateFlags.userPresence"},{"type":"text","text":" in your "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SecAccessControl"},{"type":"text","text":" configuration. This ensures the key is protected by biometrics with automatic fallback to the device passcode, providing a smooth and secure user experience across Face ID, Touch ID, and PIN‑based verification.  See "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/documentation\/security\/secaccesscontrolcreateflags"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Errors related to biometric evaluation, key generation, or enrollment."}]}],"name":"Throws","t